    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Tyler Brazeau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100079387101788158909/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLrXk4oLrplwyyRgjUVmJ3qKGPe2ih6Xe2HmDkx6AA6Gl6LQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Very nice came in with a mess and left with a brand new car. Don’t miss out on these guys real Detailers not just washers",
        "time": 1757629490,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mikhail St-Laurent",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102218913348592435888/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhDMF7iTcOwfaGKwseoQKVFihKfj4J-iCaC-ji7MUYwwHJVtvS9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I’m a little confused to what I exactly purchased here for a service. I had requested an interior and exterior clean. While the exterior was adequate, the interior seemed to be done way to hastily and with little care or attention. My carpet is soaking wet, plenty of missed spots and multiple wet trim pieces that I had to go over with a towel after. Perhaps if more pride was taken in their work this would be better, but as it stands today, I can’t recommend this place for the price.",
        "time": 1643049861,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sami Haseeba",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118023297613875073596/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5ghqXE4zJfNluVfkI1XaMuzJRRwLtDcfosmkIJBiQt0aD2g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing experience at Classique Auto Spa! They went above and beyond my expectations. Despite arriving just 15 minutes before closing, they welcomed me warmly and did an exceptional job on my car. I noticed an area between the seats that was still dirty, after they finished, and when I pointed it out, they cleaned it thoroughly with a smile and such a positive attitude. Their work was meticulous, and their customer service was outstanding. I even tried to tip them as a thank-you for their hard work, but they refused, which just shows their dedication and kindness. I promised to come back, and I absolutely will! Highly recommend this place to anyone looking for top-notch service and genuinely kind people.",
        "time": 1733011694,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rebecca R",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117083051260573105224/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSwMK4XAVRBx8JoiBAdEN_yAEyCiRvXgOZ1ZFlRdCGbj-7RBKn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Overpriced and i had to wait 1h30min before i even got into the garage with only 3 cars in front of me. Will not be returning.",
        "time": 1769892619,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "马超宇",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107055275753172431735/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqCD0oSqkzEg7tq_JNAQs_OX-YqRYwfBIk025r9l1SIWLElQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The car wash was very deceptive. They cleaned the car door and made my back seat full of water. They didn't wipe the water off. I wiped it for a long time with a towel, and they just stood there watching. They took the cash but didn't provide a receipt. The service attitude was very poor. It was a very bad experience. I thought I could find a reliable car wash shop at my doorstep. After this experience, I will never go there again.",
        "time": 1737679476,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
